⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
240 calories 23g protein (for the entire pint, mix-ins included)

Stracciatella Protein Ice Cream 😋🍦

Full recipe book (160+ flavors) linked in bio!

- 400g Fat Free High Protein Milk (like Fairlife)
- 40-45g Monk Fruit sweetener
- 5g (1 tsp) vanilla bean paste (or extract)
- A pinch of salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Mix-ins: 
- 20g chocolate chips (80 cal) mixed with 3g of coconut oil (27 cal)
Right before the Mix-In cycle, combine the chocolate with the coconut oil, melt in the microwave (30 sec intervals, stirring in between), hollow out a hole in the center of the base, and pour in. After spinning on the Mix-In setting, it’ll turn into perfect, creamy chocolate chips. 
240 cal 21g C, 9g F, 23g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run your pint under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting if necessary
5. Make a hole down to the bottom with a butter knife and fill with the melted chocolate
6. Run the “Mix-in” cycle

